s half way delays the others up to the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://NanoHTTP/documentation/NanoHTTP/NanoHTTPServerIO/Configuration-swift.struct/readTimeout","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". A socket session in the form of a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"function (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://NanoHTTP/documentation/NanoHTTP/NanoHTTPResponse/switchProtocols(_:_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":") is different: it has the thread until it returns.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc://NanoHTTP/documentation/NanoHTTP/NanoHTTPServerIO/Configuration-swift.struct/connectionQoS","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" has no effect.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://NanoHTTP/documentation/NanoHTTP":{"abstract":[{"text":"A small HTTP/1.1 server for apps and tools: routing, files, forms, uploads and WebSockets, without dependencies.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc://NanoHTTP/documentation/NanoHTTP","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","title":"NanoHTTP","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/nanohttp"},"doc://NanoHTTP/documentation/NanoHTTP/Examples":{"abstract":[{"text":"Six small programs that show how the pieces fit together, and that you can run.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc://NanoHTTP/documentation/NanoHTTP/Examples","kind":"article","role":"article","title":"Examples","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/nanohttp/examples"},"doc://NanoHTTP/documentation/NanoHTTP/NanoHTTPResponse/switchProtocols(_:_:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"code":"101 Switching Protocols","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" response. After the response was sent, ","type":"text"},{"code":"socketSession","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" runs on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"thread of the connection and owns the socket until it returns; the connection is closed afterwards.","type":"tex